---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Video from '../components/Video.astro';
import { href, channels } from '../data/site';
const profileUrl = new URL(href('about/'), Astro.site).href;
const description =
  'Meet Carl Tomich, Australian filmmaker, musician and traveller exploring his Korčula family roots and Croatian citizenship by descent journey.';
const schema = [
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'ProfilePage',
    '@id': profileUrl + '#profile',
    url: profileUrl,
    name: 'About Carl Tomich',
    mainEntity: {
      '@type': 'Person',
      '@id': profileUrl + '#carl-tomich',
      name: 'Carl Tomich',
      url: profileUrl,
      description,
      jobTitle: ['Documentary filmmaker', 'Musician', 'Travel creator'],
      sameAs: [
        'https://carltravels.com/about.html',
        'https://www.youtube.com/@thecarltomich',
      ],
      subjectOf: [
        {
          '@type': 'Article',
          name: 'Busking for Berlin: On the Streets for a Living',
          url: 'https://xpressmag.com.au/busking-for-berlin-on-the-streets-for-a-living/',
        },
      ],
    },
  },
];
---

<Base
  title="About Carl Tomich: My Croatian Roots, Music & Travel"
  description={description}
  schema={schema}
>
  <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href={href()}>Home</a> / About Carl Tomich
  </nav>
  <article class="article-wrap" style="margin-top:40px;margin-bottom:55px">
    <span class="eyebrow">The person behind Croatian By Descent Community</span>
    <h1>Carl Tomich: a guitar, a camera and a Croatian connection</h1>
    <p style="font-size:21px">
      I’m Carl Tomich, an Australian-born documentary filmmaker, musician and
      traveller with family roots on the Croatian island of Korčula. I created
      Croatian By Descent Community to share my citizenship journey and explore
      what that connection means beyond the paperwork.
    </p>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>From Perth to the streets of Berlin</h2>
      <p>
        My path here took a few detours. I grew up in Perth, spent time in
        Melbourne and built a creative life around music and film. In Melbourne,
        I made videos for bands. Watching friends busk helped spark the idea for
        a documentary that would take me to Berlin.
      </p>
      <p>
        There, I picked up a guitar and became part of the street-music world I
        was filming. That experience became <em>Busking for Berlin</em>: a film
        about performers, making a living and the everyday reality behind
        playing music on the street. My later documentary, <em>Busk Life</em>,
        returned to that world with the perspective of time.
      </p>
      <p>
        For more about that chapter, read my{' '}
        <a href="https://xpressmag.com.au/busking-for-berlin-on-the-streets-for-a-living/">
          2015 interview with X-Press Magazine
        </a>{' '}
        and explore my{' '}
        <a href="https://carltravels.com/about.html">
          filmmaking biography and selected work on Carl Travels
        </a>
        .
      </p>
      <h2>The journey that led back to Korčula</h2>
      <p>
        Croatia brought a different kind of story into focus: my own family’s.
        My grandfather’s family came from Korčula. In Croatian records he was
        Jakov Anton Tomić; in Australia he was known as James Tomich. Connecting
        those names became part of connecting my Australian life to my Croatian
        ancestry.
      </p>
      <p>
        I began looking more seriously into that history while I was in
        Australia during the pandemic. Exploring my roots became an application
        for Croatian citizenship by descent, and the application became a
        years-long exercise in patience. I gathered documents across countries,
        worked through discrepancies in family records and faced an eight-month
        delay after arriving at an appointment without a required form.
      </p>
      <p>
        When the approval finally came, I travelled to Croatia. In my September
        2026 introduction video, I described that moment while further document
        administration was still ahead. After spending years travelling and
        filming other places, I was exploring a country that was also part of my
        family’s story.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href={href('articles/welcome-to-the-community/')}>
          Read my full Croatian citizenship story
        </a>
        , including the obstacles, the wait and the approval.
      </p>
      <h2>Watch my introduction</h2>
    </div>
    <Video
      url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P5V_lPwUigw"
      title="Carl Tomich: my Croatian citizenship by descent story"
    />
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Why I created Croatian By Descent Community</h2>
      <p>
        This community brings my Croatian connection together with the music,
        travel and documentary work that came before it. I want it to be a place
        for the human side of ancestry: the families behind the documents, the
        experience of arriving somewhere new and the question of where we feel
        at home.
      </p>
      <p>
        Here you’ll find personal citizenship stories, conversations with people
        building lives in Croatia, and practical guides to its cities and
        regions. My experience is one contribution to a much wider Croatian
        diaspora story. There is room for people who are just starting to
        research their heritage, people planning a move and people who already
        call Croatia home.
      </p>
      <p>
        I write about my application from personal experience. Our practical
        guides link to official sources, and the{' '}
        <a href={href('editorial-policy/')}>editorial policy</a> explains how we
        handle sourcing and corrections. Croatian By Descent Community is the
        community website I created;{' '}
        <a href="https://croatianbydescent.com/">Croatian By Descent</a> is our
        partner website.
      </p>
      <h2>Follow my films, travels and Croatian chapter</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://carltravels.com/">Carl Travels</a> — my wider travel
          and filmmaking work.
        </li>
        {channels.map((c) => (
          <li>
            <a href={c.url}>{c.name} on YouTube</a> — {c.detail}.
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <p>
        For an interview, a film collaboration, a correction or a Croatian story
        you would like to share,{' '}
        <a href={href('contact/')}>get in touch with me and the community</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
